# ComposeBox — the "what's happening?" composer. Binds the host's @client `draft`
# and calls the host `post(draft)` action; shows reactive pending/error for free.
app FacetSocial:
    component ComposeBox():
        box:
            input bind draft placeholder "What's happening?"
            row:
                if pending(post):
                    text "Posting…"
                button "Post" -> post(draft)
            text "{failed(post)}"
